00:11.062 --> 00:14.101
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha,

00:14.102 --> 00:15.437
ha, ha, ha, ha, ha,

00:15.438 --> 00:17.707
ha, ha, ha, arrow.

