in my phone, silly.

16:20.493 --> 16:22.461
So, what do you say?
Are you free tonight?

16:22.462 --> 16:24.832
Let me consult me charts and maps.

16:24.833 --> 16:28.555
Low tide... 5:23.

16:28.556 --> 16:31.510
Oh, yeah. Moonrise, 7:48.

16:33.381 --> 16:34.744
Aye, looks like I am.

16:47.057 --> 16:49.008
Lois, I tossed a penny in a shot glass,

16:49.009 --> 16:51.993
so get your pants off and put
a towel on the kitchen table!

16:51.994 --> 16:53.814
Peter, I'm in the middle of book club.

16:53.815 --> 16:55.682
Forget book club, we're doin' it.

16:55.683 --> 16:58.066
Anyone who doesn't want to see
my big, white, flailing butt,

16:58.067 --> 16:59.880
get the hell out.

17:03.466 --> 17:05.464
Joe, I found a dollar!

17:05.465 --> 17:06.672
That's great, Bonnie!

17:06.673 --> 17:08.959
Let's go to dinner. We
can talk all about it.

17:08.960 --> 17:10.114
What's there to talk about?

17:10.115 --> 17:12.931
I looked down on the ground
and there was a dollar.

17:12.932 --> 17:15.356
Bonnie, save it for the dinner table!

17:17.482 --> 17:19.773
Crap, I don't have any change.

17:20.317 --> 17:22.703
Hey, Seamus, you got
change for a dollar?

17:22.704 --> 17:25.987
I don't know. Is my boat parked
illegally in the harbor?

17:25.988 --> 17:27.042
I don't know.

17:27.043 --> 17:28.581
Are you gonna make a contribution

17:28.582 --> 17:30.083
to the Policeman's Ball?

17:30.084 --> 17:32.756
I don't know. Are you gonna
help me move next week?

17:32.757 --> 17:35.307
Geez, what are you two,
dating or something?

17:35.612 --> 17:36.971
I don't know.

17:45.463 --> 17:48.264
Good evening, everyone.
Welcome to Whispers.

17:48.265 --> 17:50.521
I'm your hostess, Ida, and as always,

17:50.522 --> 17:53.791
I am joined by my trusty
psychic, Ryan Reynolds.

17:53.792 --> 17:55.998
I knew you'd say that.

17:55.999 --> 17:58.870
Piano? Comedy? What don't you do?

17:58.871 --> 18:00.508
Windows.

18:00.509 --> 18:03.235
Trust me, folks, he doesn't, I've tried.

18:03.236 --> 18:04.833
God, this is going well.

18:06.001 --> 18:09.457
Well, Stewie, you were right. I couldn't
make it a day without drinking.

18:09.458 --> 18:10.658
Well, the important thing is

18:10.659 --> 18:12.997
you barely tried and then got shot.

18:12.998 --> 18:15.855
So I read a fun compatibility
quiz in Cosmo.

18:15.856 --> 18:17.136
I don't know if you want to take it.

18:17.137 --> 18:18.617
- I don't.
- I didn't either!

18:18.618 --> 18:19.653
Compatible!

18:19.654 --> 18:21.311
If you'll excuse me, I have to urinate

18:21.312 --> 18:22.847
every time something good happens.

18:24.677 --> 18:26.821
I thought the show was really great.

18:26.822 --> 18:29.744
Thank you. I couldn't help but
notice you talked throughout it.

18:32.198 --> 18:33.366
Take it off!

18:33.367 --> 18:35.255
I want to see if mine look right.

18:36.557 --> 18:38.375
Well, Chris, we've looked all over town.

18:38.376 --> 18:39.879
Might as well check here.

18:39.880 --> 18:42.684
This is where dollar bills come to die.

18:42.685 --> 18:44.372
Wait, Grandpa, look!

18:47.263 --> 18:48.633
I don't believe it!

18:53.955 --> 18:56.209
Oh, no. Now we'll never find it.

18:56.210 --> 18:58.413
Hold on. I got an idea.

18:58.414 --> 19:00.751
Hey, can I turn off everything
but the black lights?

19:00.752 --> 19:03.272
- Sure, I don't care about anything.
- Cool.

19:04.308 --> 19:06.728
Wow, this place is gross!

19:06.729 --> 19:09.750
Yeah, the NBA All-Star Game
was in town last week.

19:10.520 --> 19:11.937
There it is!

19:11.938 --> 19:14.232
I got it, Grandpa!

19:14.792 --> 19:15.944
Attaboy!

19:15.945 --> 19:17.856
Happy Birthday, Grandson.

19:17.857 --> 19:19.017
Thanks.

19:19.018 --> 19:22.022
Hey, so, how much is this
rare dollar worth, anyway?

19:22.023 --> 19:24.827
Ah, well, some dildo wrote
his phone number on it,

19:24.828 --> 19:27.017
so now it's worth jack!

19:43.662 --> 19:45.031
Ho ho!

19:45.032 --> 19:47.669
Is everyone who was in the show!

19:47.670 --> 19:49.472
H-Hold on, everyone. Everyone?

19:49.473 --> 19:52.211
Ellen DeGeneres wants a
selfie of all of us.

19:52.212 --> 19:53.580
Come on, squeeze in, now.

19:53.581 --> 19:55.049
We're gonna blow up the Internet.

19:55.050 --> 19:58.273
Let's take all that we did today
and make it all about Ellen.

20:03.690 --> 20:05.386
Hey, I'm right here!

20:05.387 --> 20:07.223
That caption's a phony!

20:07.224 --> 20:09.227
Thank you for watching "Family Guy" on
www.FOX-fan.ru